      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Actually no. The static chest is certainly better now and more realistic as well, you don't move your chest for arm movement in real life unless you want to reach further. This is also regardless of FBT, both 3p and FBT use the same upper body IK thus their movement of the arms and chest are the same (unless you have elbow trackers). The previous chest movement broke a lot of things and constantly made your avatar favor one side over another when T posing for instance, making it impossible to properly T pose, this also caused a pose desync on one side compared to the other side of your body while doing exactly the same on both sides.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
