  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-15T16:56:52.450Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Might not be a big deal with FBT but this makes 3 point tracking look really unnatural when standing sometimes due to arms moving in physically impossible ways while the chest is static.",
